sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor DV as Developer
  participant SVC as Host service (Spring Boot)
  participant ENG as Rule Engine (in process)
  participant DB as Host PostgreSQL
  DV->>SVC: add starter and configuration block
  SVC->>DB: Flyway creates rle_* tables in the engine's own history
  alt a rule set masks an input and no masking key is set
    SVC-->>DV: start-up fails, key name in the message
  end
  DV->>ENG: import card-fee.yaml and publish (a single identity may publish only in the dev profile)
  DV->>SVC: JUnit with rule-engine-test, row coverage in CI
  rect rgba(14,111,104,0.08)
    Note over SVC,DB: One business transaction
    SVC->>ENG: evaluate(card-fee, inputs, correlationId=APP-7781, idempotency key)
    ENG->>DB: insert one decision row
    ENG-->>SVC: outputs, matched R2, decisionId
    SVC->>DB: store fee and decisionId on the account
  end
  alt business write fails
    SVC->>DB: rollback, the decision row rolls back with it
  else unique table with zero or two matches
    ENG-->>SVC: UNIQUE_HIT_VIOLATION, no outputs
  else same idempotency key, different body
    ENG-->>SVC: rejected
  end
